{"probe":"__P__","matched":__M__,"taken":__T__}

===== configs
--- /app/opstext/LIST.txt
dewkiln layout
==============

wickmill/boot.rs dispatches clasp.

Pipeline crates:
- hopcue/
- millrib/
- restpit/
- urncue/
- shardfold/
- lidcue/

Day files live in /app/daywell.
clasp writes /app/bloturn/ledger.json and /app/bloturn/check.json
and unpacks /app/packbay/latest.
Fixture copies of the day files sit at /app/seed/daywell.

check.json object:
- probe (string)
- matched (integer)
- taken (integer)

CI floor integer lives in /app/floorcue/MIN.txt.

Extra daywell files still use names like d20260908.tbl and d20260914.tbl.


Rebuild the binary with /app/wick.sh after source edits.

--- /app/opstext/SHIFT.txt
Nightly clasp has stayed green since the CI floor landed.
Operators still open /app/packbay/latest after incidents and find the
newest populated day file missing even when /app/daywell still holds it.
The floor value lives under floorcue/.

